completed_at: "2026-07-31T10:11:15.128Z"
claim_principal: "harness:codex"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: An exported class with semicolon-free fields has every public member judged; a field with a multi-line initialiser or a multi-line conditional is not split; no false positive appears on the repository's own sources
parent: ops-073p
resolution: Implemented bounded ASI member detection and explicit private-identifier handling with negative controls.
expected_result: Semicolon-free public fields remain independently evaluated while multiline initializers and private methods parse correctly.
actual_result: "Line-aware member boundaries preserve multiline conditionals, split ASI fields, and dispatch PrivateIdentifier methods through callable parsing."
